    {
      "id": "p0083-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Hoping for similar success outside of Japan, Nintendo localized MOTHER 2 into English and released the game as EarthBound in 1995. The game sold poorly and was quickly moved to bargain bins. Despite its commercial failure, EarthBound eventually became a cult classic that continues to influence game developers around the world.",
        "raw": "Hoping for similar success outside of Japan, Nintendo localized MOTHER 2\ninto English and released the game as EarthBound in 1995. The game sold\npoorly and was quickly moved to bargain bins. Despite its commercial\nfailure, EarthBound eventually became a cult classic that continues to\ninfluence game developers around the world.",
        "status": "corrected",
